*Commercial disclosure: I own this practice and receive revenue from its services. Its first position is promotional placement, not a neutral ranking or proof of superiority over other providers.*

In April 2026, Express Medicals sent an inbound enquiry after discovering my practice through a Bing Copilot citation. The enquiry did not become a paid engagement. It is a documented discovery example for my [AI search optimisation](/services/ai-search-optimisation/) work, not a client-conversion result.

