## Rise at Seven: Service Focus - Earned Citations Through Digital PR

**Based in:** Sheffield, with London and US offices | **Service fit:** Consumer brands commissioning digital PR | **Budget:** £3,000-6,000/mo

[Rise at Seven](https://riseatse7en.com) publishes creative, data-led digital PR work aimed at earning press coverage. That service can suit a consumer brand whose brief includes original research and earned media. Press coverage and AI URL citations are different outcomes: ask for captured AI answers and a repeated measurement method before treating the PR portfolio as evidence of GEO performance.

**Published services and evidence:** Creative, data-led digital PR for brands seeking earned media. Request separate AI-citation evidence; the PR offer does not establish a generative-engine outcome.

**Considerations:**
- Campaign-led model requires budget and client involvement
- Less focused on on-page structured data and extraction than methodology-first specialists

