## Reboot Online: Service Focus - Research-Led AI Search Experiments

**Based in:** London | **Service fit:** Evidence-based GEO in competitive markets | **Budget:** From £2,000/mo

[Reboot Online](https://rebootonline.com) publishes controlled search experiments and research-led methodology. Those publications provide work for a buyer to inspect; this directory has not established that the practice is rare or that its content causes AI citations through entity authority. Ask which experiment applies to your target platform, what was tested and whether the proposed work follows from the result.

**Published services and evidence:** Published search experiments and research-led methodology; ask which findings have been tested in the AI platforms relevant to your brief.

**Considerations:**
- Research-heavy approach rewards patience and longer engagements
