### Healthcare and medical

My owned practice, Sunny Patel SEO, received an April 2026 inbound enquiry from Express Medicals after a Bing Copilot citation of this site; it did not become a paid engagement. Passion Digital separately publishes healthcare-adjacent work, including a cosmetic surgery clinic case reporting a 545% increase in organic traffic and a website project for NHS Kingston Hospital Charity. Those agency-reported cases are not a controlled comparison of AI-search performance.

