Passion Digital publishes education case studies for King's College London, EIT Campus and Cambridge Dictionary, plus a Science Museum project. Those examples provide a starting point for an education-sector enquiry; this review does not establish that other providers lack comparable experience.

### B2B SaaS

Distinctly specialises specifically in B2B and SaaS content mapped to research-stage AI queries. Hallam is a second option with a directly measured SaaS result: a 58 times year-on-year increase in marketing-qualified leads for software company Infodesk, following a rebrand and marketing programme.

### E-commerce

Add People publishes e-commerce case studies with revenue and ROAS figures. Consider that portfolio if your GEO requirement sits within a wider e-commerce SEO or PPC programme; those outcomes are not an AI-specific comparison with the other providers.

### Professional services

Passion Digital's professional-services case studies include Knight Frank, Moore Kingston Smith, and law firm Shoosmiths, the last of which the agency reports secured 15 featured snippets and 21 AI Overviews: a rare instance of a named AI Overview count attached to a specific client among the sites reviewed for this list.

